{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Who becomes impure לו.</b> On its account — on account of the creeping thing — like הבה נתחכמה לו, and ארץ מתקוממה לו."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The phrase לו is read as 'for it / on its account'; the two biblical phrases cited (Exod 1:10 and Isa 26:5) serve as grammatical parallels for this usage."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:13.842099178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}